        "TileImage": "$($repository 1f6cbfc3-06d5-49b2-9eca-ca22bde2bbf3).Image",
        "Description": "Greetings Agent 47, it has come to my attention that a therapist that is going to visit Silvio Caruso to help uncover memories from his past. However, it appears Silvio Caruso previously worked on making multiple prototypes of bombs. And judging my Caruso&apos;s recent activity, we don&apos;t want him to remember that. Therefore, we must kill Dr. Oscar Lafayet with discretion and secrecy, or that could lead to Silvio remembering the past. Good luck 47, time will be everything in this mission.",
